#
# Apply from the root of a `git archive v1.1.28` tree:   patch -p1 < maya-score.patch
# Checked: `patch -p1 --dry-run` against src/ds4/ds4_main.cpp extracted with `git archive v1.1.28` (byte-identical to
# `git show v1.1.28:src/ds4/ds4_main.cpp`): applies cleanly, 7 hunks, no fuzz or offset.  (patch skips these leading '#' lines.)
#
# What it adds (copied from strata-v024 tag v0.2.6, src/dsv41/ds4_main.cpp lines 962-1096 and main() 1198/1263-1264/
