#     (the "name" / "ids" scan + parse_ids), same DS4_SCORE_PREFIX semantics (N > 0 and more than one segment: the
#     segments joined into one stream "concat"; the first N tokens fed as one prompt with 1 logit row; positions after
#     it scored in windows), same score.tsv row format (pos, target, logp, argmax, logp(argmax), argmax==target, logp(eos),
